{"data": [{"author_id": "1041829807011627009", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:01:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824847750742276"], "id": "2114824847750742276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Spotlight on Silvana Konermann, co-founder and Executive Director of Arc Institute and a Stanford biochemistry professor. Her lab builds CRISPR tools for engineering RNA to study Alzheimer's and other brain diseases. 🧬\n\nhttps://t.co/kyid6ymMH2\n\n#CRISPR #AIforScience", "url": "https://x.com/Shadowfetch/status/2114824847750742276"}, {"author_id": "1900249220919197696", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:36:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114833479007666381"], "id": "2114833479007666381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114479499316207978", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this doesn't even make any sense is your dick crispr https://t.co/O4lXWmFsjF", "url": "https://x.com/starrypastellar/status/2114833479007666381"}, {"author_id": "1331825191903666176", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:24:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114830674775707690"], "id": "2114830674775707690", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1,946 AI agents read a mouse brain atlas in 32 minutes.\n\nOn Oct 21, OpenAI, PerturbAI and Scripps Research posted a preprint. Each agent took one gene disruption from a whole-brain CRISPR atlas in mice. It read the cell data, searched the literature and proposed an explanation.", "url": "https://x.com/DrDan_XD/status/2114830674775707690"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114823917160546304"]}, "author_id": "852346279724146688", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:01:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["21148247